WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 line:0 size:90% align:center
Deposition. Horizontal limestone layers accumulate beneath water.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000 line:0 size:90% align:center
Folding. The sea retreats; compression folds the existing beds.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000 line:0 size:90% align:center
Erosion. Erosion truncates different beds across a new surface.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000 line:0 size:90% align:center
Burial. Younger conglomerate buries the eroded, folded beds.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000 line:0 size:90% align:center
Angular unconformity. The contact records deposition, deformation, erosion and renewed deposition.
